BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:✂️ Celebrating 40 Years of Razor’s Edge Barber Shop
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260601
UID:10001136-1777593600-1780271999@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:This year marks a special milestone for downtown Davis as Raz
 or’s Edge Barber Shop celebrates 40 years of service\, along with owne
 r Sukh Banwait’s 25th year of barbering in the community. \nSince openi
 ng its doors in 1986\, Razor’s Edge has been more than just a place for 
 a haircut—it’s been a space where stories are shared\, friendships are
  built\, and the community comes together. \nJoin us in recognizing this l
 ong-standing local business and the impact it’s had on generations in Da
 vis. Here’s to 40 years—and many more to come! 🎉
LOCATION:Razor’s Edge Barber Shop\, 130 G St.\, Ste. B\, Davis\, CA\, 95
 616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/%e2%9c%82%ef%b8%8f-celebrating-40-year
 s-of-razors-edge-barber-shop/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
